# The weekly OpenStreetMap imports of the European countries other than
# France, one group a day from Monday to Saturday, read by
# lunaway-ingest-osm-europe@<Day>.service and lunaway-ingest-pois-europe@<Day>.service
# (the instance names the key: LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Mon for @Mon). France is
# read every day by lunaway-ingest-osm.service; Sunday is left to the
# routing graph and the speed cameras of OpenStreetMap, which read every
# cached extract. Installed by infra/server/pipeline.sh, which enables one
# timer per key; infra/verify.sh checks that the groups hold every extract
# of osm_extract::EUROPE but france, once.
#
# Product owner's decision of 2026-10-06 on the download volume: France
# daily, the rest weekly. Each group is about 3 to 5 GB of Geofabrik files
# (sizes of 2026-10-06, plan/research/23-backend-europe-packs.md, M19):
# 22.7 GB a week for the 23 extracts, against 27.8 GB a day for a daily
# European run.
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Mon=--extract germany
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Tue=--extract netherlands --extract belgium --extract luxembourg --extract austria --extract switzerland --extract liechtenstein
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Wed=--extract spain --extract canary-islands --extract portugal --extract andorra --extract italy
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Thu=--extract united-kingdom --extract ireland-and-northern-ireland --extract denmark
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Fri=--extract norway --extract sweden --extract finland
LUNAWAY_EXTRACTS_Sat=--extract poland --extract czech-republic --extract slovenia --extract croatia --extract greece
